    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ed37ee85303b27a20322c3daf94a705a.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ed37ee85303b27a20322c3daf94a705a.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ed37ee85303b27a20322c3daf94a705a.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Daylight is fleeting, and the darkness holds horrors. You have been summoned to battle the creatures of shadow. Fight as an army of one, or in four player online multiplayer. Build your defences, battle the hordes, survive the night.</i><br><br>Blood Vow: Survive the Night is a strategic, wave-based action-survival game. Defend the people of Sodermark as an army of one, or online with four-player PvE multiplayer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/b70a27484c0397e1fdeefb6a931145d2.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people have taken the Blood Vow, and you have been summoned. Reward their faith by destroying the Varikavi- monstrous creatures of shadow- that have overrun the city of Sodermark.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/c01da1fdcc871b73bc68502fcd679d93.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/c01da1fdcc871b73bc68502fcd679d93.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/c01da1fdcc871b73bc68502fcd679d93.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/f4ab248d7b774de3a6caaa4fce55d2bf.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>You are a Champion of Asrin\u0117, Queen of the Gods, Goddess of the Morning Star. As you destroy the hordes of darkness, the people\u2019s faith in you, and in the Gods, will grow. The stronger their faith, the stronger you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/91820f6f3894ec5ba0ee8951212c4564.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/91820f6f3894ec5ba0ee8951212c4564.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/91820f6f3894ec5ba0ee8951212c4564.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/f8179d94ba8c9bec1256e99f924f57cb.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>The Varikavi turn to stone during the day. Use the precious daylight hours to destroy their husks, build defensive statues, and explore the city. Be wary, light fades quickly, and the night brings death.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ff6cdac39dafc2fdd50a8ca9a8c78951.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ff6cdac39dafc2fdd50a8ca9a8c78951.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ff6cdac39dafc2fdd50a8ca9a8c78951.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/56873b101644538f17ec927e877d5535.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>The gods are with you. Set down their statues and use their powers to defend the people! Utilise varied upgrade paths to support your strategies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/e875196ff0873b5b06b02de2f6296f31.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/e875196ff0873b5b06b02de2f6296f31.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/e875196ff0873b5b06b02de2f6296f31.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/711a859ae0fb39bdbcb461a78ada2990.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>The defences won\u2019t hold without you! Lead the fight in thrilling real-time combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/b075c8cbf5ac61df1d975e9a9126fa99.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/b075c8cbf5ac61df1d975e9a9126fa99.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/2bab12a8d12d9663461950e2a4a3ccb5.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the hordes of the night alone, or with up to three friends in 4 player, PvE online<strong> </strong>multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Vow calls you. Sodermark must survive the night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming in 2025. Wishlist today.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ed37ee85303b27a20322c3daf94a705a.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ed37ee85303b27a20322c3daf94a705a.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ed37ee85303b27a20322c3daf94a705a.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Daylight is fleeting, and the darkness holds horrors. You have been summoned to battle the creatures of shadow. Fight as an army of one, or in four player online multiplayer. Build your defences, battle the hordes, survive the night.</i><br><br>Blood Vow: Survive the Night is a strategic, wave-based action-survival game. Defend the people of Sodermark as an army of one, or online with four-player PvE multiplayer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/b70a27484c0397e1fdeefb6a931145d2.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people have taken the Blood Vow, and you have been summoned. Reward their faith by destroying the Varikavi- monstrous creatures of shadow- that have overrun the city of Sodermark.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/c01da1fdcc871b73bc68502fcd679d93.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/c01da1fdcc871b73bc68502fcd679d93.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/c01da1fdcc871b73bc68502fcd679d93.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/f4ab248d7b774de3a6caaa4fce55d2bf.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>You are a Champion of Asrin\u0117, Queen of the Gods, Goddess of the Morning Star. As you destroy the hordes of darkness, the people\u2019s faith in you, and in the Gods, will grow. The stronger their faith, the stronger you will become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/91820f6f3894ec5ba0ee8951212c4564.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/91820f6f3894ec5ba0ee8951212c4564.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/91820f6f3894ec5ba0ee8951212c4564.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/f8179d94ba8c9bec1256e99f924f57cb.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>The Varikavi turn to stone during the day. Use the precious daylight hours to destroy their husks, build defensive statues, and explore the city. Be wary, light fades quickly, and the night brings death.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ff6cdac39dafc2fdd50a8ca9a8c78951.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ff6cdac39dafc2fdd50a8ca9a8c78951.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/ff6cdac39dafc2fdd50a8ca9a8c78951.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/56873b101644538f17ec927e877d5535.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>The gods are with you. Set down their statues and use their powers to defend the people! Utilise varied upgrade paths to support your strategies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/e875196ff0873b5b06b02de2f6296f31.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/e875196ff0873b5b06b02de2f6296f31.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/e875196ff0873b5b06b02de2f6296f31.mp4?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/711a859ae0fb39bdbcb461a78ada2990.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span>The defences won\u2019t hold without you! Lead the fight in thrilling real-time combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/b075c8cbf5ac61df1d975e9a9126fa99.poster.avif?t=1754557363\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/b075c8cbf5ac61df1d975e9a9126fa99.webm?t=1754557363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461150/extras/2bab12a8d12d9663461950e2a4a3ccb5.avif?t=1754557363\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the hordes of the night alone, or with up to three friends in 4 player, PvE online<strong> </strong>multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Vow calls you. Sodermark must survive the night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming in 2025. Wishlist today.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
